=== Root cause
Line 119, 17:17:20: RuntimeError: Could not find nvcc and default cuda_home='/usr/local/cuda' doesn't exist
Raised in flashinfer/jit/cpp_ext.py get_cuda_path(), called while FlashInfer JIT-builds its sampling module
